=======
GRF Name : ADRS - AIRS Diplomacy Fork

This version of ADRS is created using repository version ${git_info.get_revision()}

ADRS is a fork of AIRS (Age of Industry Replacement Set) by andybiotic, itself
descended from FIRS by andythenorth, FooBar, planetmaker, Terkhen, Yexo and many
other contributors. Thanks to *all* who helped create AIRS and FIRS.

